sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Parent
    participant WVL as WireViewLayout
    participant Shared as pkgm-shared (MenuChannelMeta, MenuInteraction)
    participant WireCard as WireCardLayout (inline content)

    Parent->>WVL: props (content, channelLogo, userName, timeAgo, viewsText, onLike, onComment, commentValue, onCommentChange, onSubmitComment, ...)

    WVL->>WVL: comment input state (controlled or internal)
    WVL->>Shared: MenuChannelMeta
    WVL->>WVL: render content text (wire body)
    WVL->>Shared: MenuInteraction (like, dislike, share, comment, repost, menu)
    WVL->>WVL: comment input row (emoji, TextInput, Post)

    User->>Shared: tap Like / Dislike / Share / Comment / Repost
    Shared->>Parent: onLike() / onComment() / ...

    User->>WVL: type in comment input
    WVL->>Parent: onCommentChange(value) or setInternalValue

    User->>WVL: tap Post
    WVL->>WVL: handlePostPress() — trim, submit
    WVL->>Parent: onSubmitComment()
    WVL->>WVL: clear input if uncontrolled